                                Mail Master
                      -------------------------------
                         © 1997 by Conny Ankargren

What is this ?
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
This is as simple as an Online version of the Areafix/Raid function. It
lets the Sysops on the Sites you have configured tur on/off areas etc
Online in your BBS instead of mailing letters to Areafix/raid and then
wait for reply.

I dont thinki need to say so much more, its just to install it and
hopefully your donwnlinks will get happy :-)

Installation:
~~~~~~~~~~~~~

Filename:          Copy To:             Description
--------           --------------       ------------
Freport            BBS:C/               v1.21, Output fixed (MUST USE!)
MailmasterENG.E!   *DOORS:Mailmaster/   The Arexx Door (English version)
MailmasterSV.E!    *DOORS:Mailmaster/   The Arexx Door (Swedish version)
Exit.txt           *DOORS:Mailmaster/   Textfile
Enter.txt          *DOORS:Mailmaster/   Textfile
PKTMail            C:                   Needed for posting letters
#?.library         LIBS:                Needed Libs


* This is the default search path for the door, if you wish to use another
  path then simply set the ENV variable MMPATH.
  (Ex: SETENV MMPATH "Dh2:MM/", then copy ENV:MMPATH to Envarc:)

You must also assign IN: to your Inbound directory. Otherwise PKTMail
wont work and the areas can never be toggled.

Then simply install the Door as an Exclusive Arexx Door. Perhaps in your
EX.Bbsmenus file like this:

 607,     MAIL,     0,      "1-32",   "\#1Doors:Mailmaster/MailmasterENG.E!\"


Usage:
~~~~~~
Well, its very easy to work with. The only thing you must do is to enter
the Site Config Option in the Doors Sysop menu and configure the users
that should have access to Areafix/Raid.

As Sysop you can also toggle areas on/off for a site quick and easy.

